Z||000004||wahoo4u||08-02-2000||11:25 PM||||just recently installed exhaust off of a dead formula  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> onto an 84 SE  along with the rear facia.  Went on fairly easy.  Even with adding five in chrome tips on each end instead of the normal tips.  didn't change the exhaust notes much, but you should see some of the looks that i get.  The tires and the paint job doesn't help much either.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000005||Philphine||08-03-2000||03:01 AM||||my '87 4 cyl. has fiero gt dual exhaust with 5" tips also. fits like stock. my indy came with duals stock. when i was looking to get my '87 done one shop said when fieros were first out they were doing about 1 conversion a week. ||||reg||1
